  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FastlyOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Fastly Compute@Edge -- the WebAssembly-powered edge serverless platform with global PoP coverage. OASIS avatars and holons are stored in Fastly KV Store and served with sub-millisecond edge latency worldwide. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- chore: preserve pending workspace changes (76823ca)\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 11 new OASIS providers — Maps (4), Blockchain (2), Network (3), Storage (2) (e1538d7)\n- feat(edge storage): Fastly KV and Netlify Blobs providers on the shared KV base, with protocol tests (2f05c05)\n- fix: resolve all build errors in 11 new OASIS providers (2d0a601)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FastlyOASIS",
